Provenance of nfswolf-xdr-derive
================================

This crate contains code derived from the Vaiz/nfs3 project
<https://github.com/Vaiz/nfs3>, which is released into the public domain under
the Unlicense.

The Unlicense places no conditions on copying, modification, or relicensing.
This NOTICE records the origin as a matter of good practice, not obligation.

Code absorbed from Vaiz/nfs3 (Unlicense):

  From crate nfs3_macros:
    src/lib.rs                  -> src/lib.rs

Deviations from upstream (workspace-wide):

  * The smol runtime backend was dropped; only tokio is supported.
  * The RPC credential and verifier are settable on an established connection,
    so an AUTH_SYS identity can be swapped mid-session without reconnecting.
  * PROG_MISMATCH replies preserve the server's supported (low, high) version
    range instead of collapsing to an opaque error.
  * The NFSv3 server implementation was not absorbed; NFSWolf depends on the
    published nfs3_server crate as a dev-dependency for integration tests.
